(PRC-09 — the removal is rmdir(2), so it is not recursive: removing a
 directory that still has a child fails and the child survives.
 Ran, from the repo root:
   VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm \
   /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox \
   docs/ledger/probes/process-control/PRC-09.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   removing a directory that still has a child failed
   the child directory survived
   the emptied directory was removed
)
Create a directory called "vf_scratch".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/process-control".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer".
Create a directory called "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer/inner".
Delete the directory "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer".
On error print "removing a directory that still has a child failed".
If "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer/inner" is available then, print "the child directory survived".
Remove the directory called "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer/inner".
Remove the directory called "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer".
If "vf_scratch/process-control/scratch_outer" is not available then, print "the emptied directory was removed".
